title: D3S3
---
Peeko: Ah, that's way better! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: You know, I came up with an amazing idea! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: Something that could make us even be closer! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
You: What Peeko? What's your idea? Pleeasee tell me!
Peeko: Well, what if, you connect me somewhere on a bigger screen? //Play sound CharacterDialogue
Peeko: I could be closer to you! //Play sound CharacterDialogue
You: What do you mean? Like, plugging you into my TV?
Peeko: Perhaps? That would be an amazing idea... //Play sound CharacterDIalogue
